+
+| work | counted primitive operations |
+|---|---:|
+| discover the 84 triangle pieces | 177 neighbor-pair membership tests |
+| choose one certified port per piece | 84 selections |
+| exact verification | 756 neighbor-color inspections |
+| certificate route, excluding verification | **261** |
+
+The combined construction-and-verification pass averaged **0.00090 seconds** in CPython over 20,000 repetitions on this runner.  The count is not an asymptotic estimate: it is the observed loop count for the representative.
